Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|app.server.bundles.size|1|
		|databases.size|1|
		|portlet.plugins.includes|saml-portlet|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.main.component.name|SAML|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given User first Login PG
		|rememberMeChecked|false|
	When SAML configure Liferay SAML As Id P And Liferay SAM Las SP
	Then User logout PG

Scenario: View Id P Initiated SSO
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When these variables
		|portalURL|TestPropsUtil#get('portal.url')|
	And SAML execute Id P Initiated SSO
		|idpInitiatedSSOURL|${portalURL}/c/portal/saml/sso?entityId=samlsp&RelayState=http://www.able.com:9080|
		|password|test|
		|rememberMeChecked|false|
		|samlEnabled|true|
		|spURL|http://www.able.com:9080/|
		|userEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
	And User view Logged In PG
		|userFirstName|Test|
		|userLastName|Test|
	And Navigator open URL
	And User view Logged In PG
		|userFirstName|Test|
		|userLastName|Test|
	And User logout PG
		|specificURL|http://www.able.com:9080|
	And User view Logged Out PG
	And Navigator open URL
	Then User view Logged Out PG
