Scenario: View Single Logout HTTP Post Binding In Console
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|CPSAML#ViewSingleLogoutHTTPPostBindingInConsole|
	And these variables
		|portalURL|TestPropsUtil#get('portal.url')|
	And User login PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Server Administration|
	And ServerAdministration add Category Log Levels
		|catagoryName|com.liferay.saml|
		|categoryPriority|DEBUG|
	And User logout PG
	And SAML execute Id P Initiated SSO
		|idpInitiatedSSOURL|${portalURL}/c/portal/saml/sso?entityId=samlsp&RelayState=http://www.able.com:9080|
		|password|test|
		|rememberMeChecked|true|
		|samlEnabled|true|
		|spURL|http://www.able.com:9080/|
		|userEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
	And AssertConsoleTextPresent the value 'Sending SAML message <?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>_<saml2p:Response Destination="http://www.able.com:9080/c/portal/saml/acs"'
	And User logout PG
		|specificURL|http://www.able.com:9080|
	Then AssertConsoleTextPresent the value 'Validation of protocol message signature succeeded, message type: {urn:oasis:names:tc:SAML:2.0:protocol}LogoutRequest'
Scenario: View SP Initiated SSO
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
